      "rationale": "poetics init (#24), as the plan describes. It detects React and Svelte from the dependencies of the root and every workspace package (pnpm-workspace.yaml or package.json workspaces), falling back to .tsx and .svelte files. It scopes the config to each package's src/ and excludes tests and build output, uses a tsconfig only if it has compiler options, and plans the snapshot backfill (ADR 0011). Tried on taxonomy, shadcn-svelte and TanStack Query.",
